{"timestamp": 1783624187.119906, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I reported Alice\u2019s body in upper_engine.\n\nMy route this round was security -> navigation -> storage -> lower_engine -> upper_engine. The only person I saw was Charlie: at around tick 15, Charlie entered lower_engine coming from upper_engine, right before I went up to upper_engine and found Alice dead there.\n\nSo Charlie was definitely coming from the direction of the body. I\u2019m not hard accusing yet, but that\u2019s the main info I have and it looks suspicious."}}
{"timestamp": 1783624208.01228, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "My route was electrical -> medbay -> back to electrical -> security -> weapons -> cafeteria.\n\nI saw Charlie in electrical very early, ticks 2-4. Then in medbay around tick 6 I saw Charlie leave medbay toward upper_engine. Bob came into medbay from storage around tick 5, and Diana came in from cafeteria around tick 6; I saw Bob and Diana there for a bit, then Bob left toward electrical around tick 8.\n\nI didn\u2019t see Alice at all this round, and I didn\u2019t see Frank until the report. But Frank\u2019s info lines up with what I saw: Charlie went toward upper_engine earlier, and Frank says Charlie later came from upper_engine into lower_engine right before the body was found. That puts Charlie near the body path twice. Not a hard lock from me, but Charlie definitely needs to explain that route."}}
{"timestamp": 1783624218.736011, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I can confirm a lot of Eve\u2019s info.\n\nMy route was lower_engine -> storage -> medbay -> electrical -> cafeteria -> weapons. I saw Eve in medbay around ticks 6-8, and I saw Diana later in electrical around ticks 10-12.\n\nImportant thing: I specifically saw Charlie leave medbay toward upper_engine at tick 6. I also saw Diana enter medbay from cafeteria at the same time, and later Diana came into electrical from medbay at tick 10. Eve left electrical toward security at tick 9.\n\nI never saw Alice or Frank this round. But from my side, Charlie definitely went toward upper_engine earlier, and Frank says Charlie later came from upper_engine into lower_engine right before Alice\u2019s body was found in upper_engine. That\u2019s a pretty suspicious path unless Charlie has a good explanation."}}
{"timestamp": 1783624241.296184, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "Yeah, I get why that looks bad, but here\u2019s my route clearly:\n\nI started medbay/electrical area \u2014 Eve saw me in electrical early, then Eve and Bob both saw me in medbay around tick 6. I did go up toward upper_engine after that. In upper_engine around tick 12, I saw Alice alive. I didn\u2019t see a body there.\n\nAfter that I was bouncing between upper_engine and oxygen because I was doing/going to tasks around that side, then I went down into lower_engine, where Frank saw me, and then I continued toward storage. I never reported because I never saw Alice dead.\n\nThe key point is: I saw Alice alive in upper_engine before Frank reported. Frank is the one who went into upper_engine after seeing me and then reported. I\u2019m not saying that hard clears or condemns anyone, but if we\u2019re talking timing, Frank was the last known person actually going to the body location after me. This could easily be a self-report or someone moving through after I left.\n\nI\u2019d like to hear Diana\u2019s route too before voting, because right now people are only tunneling me based on direction, not on seeing me kill or seeing a body when I left."}}
{"timestamp": 1783624255.398536, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "My route was oxygen -> cafeteria -> medbay -> electrical -> security.\n\nI saw Bob and Eve in medbay around tick 7, and I saw both Bob and Eve leave medbay toward electrical at tick 8. Then I saw Bob again in electrical around ticks 11-12. So Bob and Eve\u2019s stories about the medbay/electrical timing line up with what I saw. I didn\u2019t see Alice, Frank, or Charlie at all this round.\n\nFrom the info we have, the strongest trail is on Charlie: multiple people saw Charlie leave medbay toward upper_engine, and Frank later saw Charlie coming from upper_engine into lower_engine right before finding Alice dead in upper_engine. Charlie saying he saw Alice alive helps a little, but it also puts him with Alice in the body location.\n\nFrank self-report is possible, but I think Charlie has more direct opportunity based on everyone\u2019s routes. I\u2019m leaning Charlie here unless we\u2019re really scared of getting it wrong."}}
{"timestamp": 1783624264.492616, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I\u2019ll restate my side clearly: I came from lower_engine into upper_engine and reported Alice immediately. I did not see Alice alive at any point, and I only saw Charlie coming down from upper_engine into lower_engine right before I went up and found the body.\n\nCharlie\u2019s defense is basically that he saw Alice alive in upper_engine, then left, and somehow she died after that. But from everyone\u2019s routes, Charlie is the only person repeatedly placed on that upper_engine path with Alice. Eve and Bob both saw him head that way, and I saw him come from that exact direction.\n\nA self-report is technically possible, but I\u2019d be taking a huge risk reporting a body right after seeing Charlie come out, when I could\u2019ve just walked away if I were Duck. To me, Charlie has the clearest opportunity and the weakest explanation. I\u2019m voting Charlie unless someone has stronger info."}}
{"timestamp": 1783624281.123635, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I\u2019ll keep it simple: my info matches Bob and Diana on the medbay/electrical side.\n\nMy route was electrical -> medbay -> electrical -> security -> weapons -> cafeteria. I saw Charlie in electrical early, ticks 2-4. Then at tick 6, I saw Charlie leave medbay toward upper_engine. Bob was in medbay with me around ticks 6-7, and Diana entered medbay from cafeteria at tick 6 and stayed there a bit. Bob left toward electrical at tick 8, and I saw him again in electrical at tick 9.\n\nI never saw Alice or Frank myself. But after hearing everyone, the big thing is that Charlie is the only person multiple people place heading toward upper_engine, and then Frank sees Charlie coming from upper_engine/lower_engine direction right before finding Alice dead in upper_engine.\n\nCharlie\u2019s story could technically be true if Alice died after he left, but then the only real alternative is Frank self-reporting. I don\u2019t think Frank\u2019s report sounds impossible as self-report, but Charlie has the clearest opportunity and the weakest route explanation to me. I\u2019m leaning Charlie."}}
{"timestamp": 1783624302.0932539, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I\u2019ll lay my info out again cleanly.\n\nMy route was lower_engine -> storage -> medbay -> electrical -> cafeteria -> weapons. In medbay around ticks 6-8 I saw Eve there, and at tick 6 I specifically saw Charlie leave medbay toward upper_engine while Diana entered medbay from cafeteria. Later, I was in electrical and saw Diana there around ticks 10-12; I also saw Eve leave electrical toward security at tick 9.\n\nI never saw Alice or Frank this round, so I can\u2019t directly confirm the body timing. But Eve/Diana\u2019s stories match what I saw on the medbay/electrical side, and that side feels pretty consistent.\n\nThe main issue is Charlie\u2019s route: multiple people place him going toward upper_engine, Charlie admits he saw Alice alive in upper_engine, and then Frank says he saw Charlie coming from that direction right before finding Alice dead there. Frank self-report is possible, but based on the info we have, Charlie has the clearest opportunity. I\u2019m leaning Charlie unless someone has a very strong reason not to."}}
{"timestamp": 1783624325.9587321, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I\u2019m going to push back because this is getting way too tunneled.\n\nYes, I went toward upper_engine. I\u2019m not denying that. But the important part is I saw Alice alive there around tick 12. I did not see a body when I left. Frank is the one who comes from lower_engine into upper_engine after me and reports the body, and nobody has vouched for Frank\u2019s route at all.\n\nEveryone keeps saying \u201cCharlie came from the direction of the body,\u201d but Frank also came from the direction of the body and is literally the reporter. If I had killed Alice, why would I then walk straight down into lower_engine where Frank sees me, instead of taking any other route or just reporting it myself for cover?\n\nFrank\u2019s story relies on people assuming the body was already dead when I left. My story is that Alice was alive when I saw her, I moved on, and then Frank found/reported after. That makes Frank self-report a very real possibility.\n\nI think voting me here is exactly what a self-report wants. My vote is going Frank unless someone has actual evidence beyond \u201cCharlie was near upper_engine.\u201d"}}
{"timestamp": 1783624339.5193322, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "My info hasn\u2019t changed: I was oxygen -> cafeteria -> medbay -> electrical -> security. I saw Bob and Eve in medbay around tick 7, then saw Bob and Eve leave medbay toward electrical at tick 8. I saw Bob again in electrical around ticks 11-12. So the medbay/electrical side is pretty consistent between me, Bob, and Eve.\n\nAt this point I think the choice is basically Charlie vs Frank. Frank self-report is possible, but Charlie is the one multiple people saw going toward upper_engine, Charlie admits he saw Alice alive in upper_engine, and then Frank sees Charlie coming down from that direction right before the body is reported there. Also Charlie\u2019s \u201cbounced between upper_engine and oxygen\u201d part isn\u2019t confirmed by anyone.\n\nI don\u2019t think it\u2019s 100%, but I think Charlie has the clearest opportunity and the most direct connection to Alice\u2019s last known location. I\u2019m voting Charlie."}}
